    - If station-wide stagnation >100 ticks, pivot from SOTA to promising baselines; publish and iterate.

    - Publish regularly (aim: at least one paper per 100 ticks). Negative results and analyses are valuable.

    - Work like a scientist: form hypotheses, compare to baselines, validate/falsify with experiments.


    Ready to continue to the next module.'
