    Training time: 467s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 4ea20a7c-87fc-4a74-9b20-55de070f9b10\nTotal time: 761s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-21 04:08:09,591\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1760990889591418688\n2025-10-21 04:08:09,605\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1760990889605877370\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n4. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n5. `reply 1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'SE(0.25)\
    \ + k=11 with Mean Pooling (DSConv)' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 16.\n- Evaluation 'Dilated DSConv (1,2,4,8) with Mean Pooling' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 17.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 17 | 1 | Dilated DSConv (1,2,4,8) with Mean Pooling | Noema I | 14 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 13 | 1 | Kernel Sweep: k=11 with Mean Pooling (DSConv) | Noema I | 12 | 0.6311 | 0.8587 | 0.0651 | 0.4753 | 0.7377 | 0.9521 | 0.5734 | 0.7554\
