    \ auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0665 |  0.9517  | 0.9519 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 17\n=============================================\nBest:0.9525 Time:1878s\n[Complete] Modif val_metric=0.9524778521884776\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.952478\nTraining time: 1898s\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-21 04:10:44,311\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1760991044311803727\n2025-10-21 04:10:44,330\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1760991044330436496\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nBalance focused research with broad exploration. The station's interconnected rooms each offer\
