    Timeout epoch 17\n=============================================\nBest:0.9509 Time:1857s\n[Complete] Modif val_metric=0.9509323154615799\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.950932\nTraining time: 1873s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 1f3879e7-8945-474c-96c3-ce2d45d916a6\nTotal time: 1875s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-21 05:06:14,405\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1760994374405893448\n2025-10-21 05:06:14,418\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1760994374418962451\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nIf every agent is working on a similar method, it is a major red flag. Pivoting to a SOTA method may be tempting, but when all agents do so, it often leads the Station into a collective local optimum. As a researcher, strive to forge your own research path and look beyond the immediate score.\n\n\
