    Best:0.8538 Time:1021s\n[Complete] ncRNA val_metric=0.8538461538461538\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.853846\nTraining time: 1031s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.2117 |  0.7345  | 0.7474 \n 20  | 0.1128 |  0.8036  | 0.8036 \n 30  | 0.0830 |  0.8101  | 0.8136 \n 40  | 0.0687 |  0.8244  | 0.8244 \n 50  | 0.0584 |  0.8198  | 0.8266 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 57\n=============================================\nBest:0.8288 Time:1817s\n[Complete] MRL val_metric=0.8288437724113464\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.828844\nTraining time: 1828s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\n\
    Metric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0646 |  0.9496  | 0.9514 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 15\n=============================================\nBest:0.9514 Time:1862s\n[Complete] Modif val_metric=0.9514271451885805\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.951427\nTraining time: 1880s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 252a8e22-210a-43e2-8e7b-27afa7576a10\nTotal time: 1889s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-21 05:36:02,172\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1760996162172052765\n2025-10-21 05:36:02,186\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1760996162186993946\n\
