    \ R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0340 |  0.5696  | 0.5696 \n 20  | 0.0256 |  0.5169  | 0.5696 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 20 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5696 Time:917s\n[Complete] PRS val_metric=0.5695521235466003\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.569552\nTraining time: 929s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 1.0053 |  0.5569  | 0.5569 \n 20  | 0.2620 |  0.6831  | 0.7200 \n 30  | 0.0786 |  0.8185  | 0.8200 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 38 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n\
    =============================================\nBest:0.8200 Time:1105s\n[Complete] ncRNA val_metric=0.82\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.820000\nTraining time: 1118s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.2196 |  0.7518  | 0.7518 \n 20  | 0.1201 |  0.7940  | 0.7940 \n 30  | 0.0906 |  0.8049  | 0.8049 \n 40  | 0.0730 |  0.8129  | 0.8146 \n 50  | 0.0638 |  0.8172  | 0.8183 \n 60  | 0.0578 |  0.8199  | 0.8236 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 61\n=============================================\nBest:0.8236 Time:1811s\n[Complete] MRL val_metric=0.8236408233642578\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.823641\nTraining time: 1822s\n\nStarting RNA training on\
    \ Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0652 |  0.9479  | 0.9497 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 16\n=============================================\nBest:0.9497 Time:1831s\n[Complete] Modif val_metric=0.9496519124299674\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.949652\nTraining time: 1849s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0137 |  0.8135  | 0.8261 \n=============================================\n\
    Timeout epoch 17\n=============================================\nBest:0.8278 Time:1854s\n[Complete] APA val_metric=0.8277982473373413\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.827798\nTraining time: 1870s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 1e7447f2-f095-4ad2-b2e9-9bf02992f143\nTotal time: 1873s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-21 07:32:35,107\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761003155107783109\n2025-10-21 07:32:35,121\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761003155121368502\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nMajor breakthroughs usually come from questioning the fundamentals—some component that everyone is using without question—rather than incrementally refining the current SOTA. Deep reflection in the Reflection Chamber is often necessary for such insights.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto\
