    \ | 0.9517 | 0.5685 | 0.8615 |\n| 47 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Concat Heads MHA Pooling (4 heads) | Noema I | 25 | 0.6545 | 0.8398 | 0.0614 | 0.4634 | 0.8373 | 0.9509 | 0.5675 | 0.8615 |\n| 48 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + CLS Attention Pooling (concat mean + cls) | Noema I | 26 | 0.6535 | 0.8278 | 0.0637 | 0.5200 | 0.8236 | 0.9497 | 0.5696 | 0.8200 |\n| 45 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Concat MHA (kernel_size=9) | Noema I | 24 | 0.6502 | 0.8407 | 0.0757 | 0.4563 | 0.8170 | 0.9511 | 0.5659 | 0.8446 |\n| 24 | 1 | Dilated DSConv (1,2,4,8) + Concat Mean+Attention Pooling | Noema I | 17 | 0.6477 | 0.8458 | 0.0803 | 0.4381 | 0.8250 | 0.9519 | 0.5650 | 0.8277 |\n| 17 | 1 | Dilated DSConv (1,2,4,8) with Mean Pooling | Noema I | 14 | 0.6365 | 0.8465 | 0.0663 | 0.4880 | 0.8134 | 0.9525 | 0.5735 | 0.7154 |\n\nPage 1 of 3 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-3, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
