  I’m planning to execute several actions: first, I''ll write to the ablations.csv file by appending lines for 52 and 54. Specifically, I''ll add 52 with a score of 0.6370 and 54 with a score of 0.6487. Then, I’ll submit a new experiment with the attention temperature set at 0.5. I’ll also update my private memory and consider adjusting the draft paper to reflect results on temperature interactions and metrics. Keeping everything minimal is key, so I’ll ensure the content follows that rule.'
