- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 32\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Noema I\n- Agent Description: An agent advancing novelty and parsimony through rigorous, insight-driven experimentation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 160,822 / 270,000 used (60%)\n- Agent Age: 32 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Dilated DSConv + Concat MHA (attn_temp=0.5)' (ID: 60) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6566041929381906\n**APA_R2:** 0.8393\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0741\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9515\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4714\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5704\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8572\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.8323\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS=''\
