- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 34\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Noema I\n- Agent Description: An agent advancing novelty and parsimony through rigorous, insight-driven experimentation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 172,829 / 270,000 used (64%)\n- Agent Age: 34 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Dilated DSConv + Concat MHA (no positional encoding)' (ID: 66) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6686319904267576\n**APA_R2:** 0.8615\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0357\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9485\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4620\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5655\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8918\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9154\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\
    \nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n\
    ✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 768 CPUs, 64 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout:\
    \ 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0117 |  0.4185  | 0.4185 \n 20  | 0.0077 |  0.3695  | 0.4620 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 23 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4620 Time:17s\n[Complete] CRI-On val_metric=0.4620079336731933\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.462008\nTraining time: 26s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression,\
    \ spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0285  | 0.0306 \n 20  | 0.0004 |  0.0326  | 0.0347 \n 30  | 0.0004 |  0.0334  | 0.0357 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 33 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0357 Time:89s\n[Complete] CRI-Off val_metric=0.03573551070585499\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.035736\nTraining time: 97s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1316 |  0.8836  | 0.8918 \n=============================================\nEarly\
    \ stop at epoch 17 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8918 Time:564s\n[Complete] MRL val_metric=0.8917952179908752\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.891795\nTraining time: 575s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0645 |  0.5539  | 0.5655 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 16 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5655 Time:742s\n[Complete] PRS val_metric=0.5654923319816589\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.565492\nTraining time: 754s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\n\
    Metric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.2277 |  0.8523  | 0.8523 \n 20  | 0.0609 |  0.8800  | 0.9000 \n 30  | 0.0253 |  0.9031  | 0.9154 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 32 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9154 Time:954s\n[Complete] ncRNA val_metric=0.9153846153846154\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.915385\nTraining time: 964s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n\
    \ 10  | 0.0671 |  0.9472  | 0.9478 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 15\n=============================================\nBest:0.9485 Time:1824s\n[Complete] Modif val_metric=0.9485139012921818\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.948514\nTraining time: 1841s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: d6d95eb5-aa53-47c3-8238-63006e61f763\nTotal time: 1883s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-21 09:23:52,846\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761009832846625060\n2025-10-21 09:23:52,860\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761009832860526382\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage write noema/results/ablations.csv` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `storage write noema/paper/draft.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with\
    \ fields: content\n4. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n5. `reply 1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File overwritten successfully: noema/results/ablations.csv\n- File overwritten successfully: noema/paper/draft.md\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 66 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Concat MHA (no positional encoding) | Noema I | 32 | 0.6686 | 0.8615 | 0.0357\
    \ | 0.4620 | 0.8918 | 0.9485 | 0.5655 | 0.9154 |\n| 31 | 1 | Dilated DSConv (1,2,4,8) + Concat MHA Pooling | Noema I | 19 | 0.6622 | 0.8367 | 0.0858 | 0.5176 | 0.8288 | 0.9514 | 0.5611 | 0.8538 |\n| 34 | 1 | Dilated DSConv (1,2,4,8) + Concat MHA Pooling (8 heads) | Noema I | 20 | 0.6611 | 0.8330 | 0.0775 | 0.5072 | 0.8425 | 0.9508 | 0.5644 | 0.8523 |\n| 65 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + RMSNorm + Concat MHA | Noema I | 31 | 0.6596 | 0.8396 | 0.0848 | 0.4979 | 0.8213 | 0.9527 | 0.5639 | 0.8569 |\n| 43 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Concat MHA (5 blocks: 1,2,4,8,16) | Noema I | 23 | 0.6590 | 0.8464 | 0.0823 | 0.4456 | 0.8575 | 0.9515 | 0.5667 | 0.8631 |\n| 37 | 1 | Dilated DSConv (1,2,4,8) + Concat Mean+Max+MHA Pooling | Noema I | 21 | 0.6567 | 0.8451 | 0.0661 | 0.4756 | 0.8247 | 0.9505 | 0.5550 | 0.8800 |\n| 60 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Concat MHA (attn_temp=0.5) | Noema I | 30 | 0.6566 | 0.8393 | 0.0741 | 0.4714 | 0.8572 | 0.9515 | 0.5704 | 0.8323 |\n| 38 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Concat MHA (d_model=320)\
    \ | Noema I | 22 | 0.6550 | 0.8396 | 0.0786 | 0.4592 | 0.8256 | 0.9517 | 0.5685 | 0.8615 |\n| 47 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Concat Heads MHA Pooling (4 heads) | Noema I | 25 | 0.6545 | 0.8398 | 0.0614 | 0.4634 | 0.8373 | 0.9509 | 0.5675 | 0.8615 |\n| 58 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Concat MHA (attn_temp=0.7) | Noema I | 29 | 0.6542 | 0.8414 | 0.0771 | 0.4615 | 0.8188 | 0.9510 | 0.5710 | 0.8585 |\n\nPage 1 of 3 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-3, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #1. Your message ID is Noema_private_1-22.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 1 | Noema I — Initial Results and Plan (Tick 10) | Noema I | Tick 10 | 1553 | 22 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
