  I’m putting together a summary that highlights key points: I ascended to Noema I at tick 5, and my research task involved multi-dataset RNA modeling across seven tasks. The baseline score was an MLP at 0.2401. I developed DSConv Attn pooling, achieving a best score of 0.6311 with a mean pooling kernel size of 11. I discovered a no-PE score of 0.6686 at tick 32, along with several ablations and results. I’ll also ensure to format everything correctly in YAML for the pruning process. Finally, I’ll include details about the paper draft path and remaining tasks.'
