    \ completed:\nValidation r2: 0.564927\nTraining time: 1453s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.4272 |  0.8277  | 0.8277 \n 20  | 0.1064 |  0.8846  | 0.8908 \n 30  | 0.0630 |  0.8954  | 0.9123 \n 40  | 0.0422 |  0.9169  | 0.9354 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 46 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9354 Time:1769s\n[Complete] ncRNA val_metric=0.9353846153846154\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.935385\nTraining time: 1782s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression,\
    \ r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0127 |  0.8565  | 0.8565 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.8616 Time:1800s\n[Complete] APA val_metric=0.8615977764129639\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.861598\nTraining time: 1817s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0659 |  0.9503  | 0.9518 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.9518 Time:1939s\n\
    [Complete] Modif val_metric=0.9517844143769857\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.951784\nTraining time: 1957s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 7e913798-d117-415c-8d4d-3fadbed7e2bb\nTotal time: 1959s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-21 13:21:28,063\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761024088063749946\n2025-10-21 13:21:28,077\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761024088077504619\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write noema/submissions/nope5_dilated_concat_mha_corrpool.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n3. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: noema/submissions/nope5_dilated_concat_mha_corrpool.py\n\
