    \ 60 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Concat MHA (attn_temp=0.5) | Noema I | 30 | 0.6566 | 0.8393 | 0.0741 | 0.4714 | 0.8572 | 0.9515 | 0.5704 | 0.8323 |\n| 58 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Concat MHA (attn_temp=0.7) | Noema I | 29 | 0.6542 | 0.8414 | 0.0771 | 0.4615 | 0.8188 | 0.9510 | 0.5710 | 0.8585 |\n| 54 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Dual-Dilation Interaction + Concat MHA | Noema I | 28 | 0.6487 | 0.8081 | 0.0751 | 0.4710 | 0.8291 | 0.9512 | 0.5681 | 0.8385 |\n| 52 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Concat MHA (dropout=0.05) | Noema I | 27 | 0.6370 | 0.8317 | 0.0685 | 0.4429 | 0.7699 | 0.9512 | 0.5611 | 0.8338 |\n| 48 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + CLS Attention Pooling (concat mean + cls) | Noema I | 26 | 0.6535 | 0.8278 | 0.0637 | 0.5200 | 0.8236 | 0.9497 | 0.5696 | 0.8200 |\n| 47 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Concat Heads MHA Pooling (4 heads) | Noema I | 25 | 0.6545 | 0.8398 | 0.0614 | 0.4634 | 0.8373 | 0.9509 | 0.5675 | 0.8615 |\n| 45 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Concat MHA (kernel_size=9) | Noema I | 24 | 0.6502 | 0.8407 | 0.0757\
    \ | 0.4563 | 0.8170 | 0.9511 | 0.5659 | 0.8446 |\n| 43 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Concat MHA (5 blocks: 1,2,4,8,16) | Noema I | 23 | 0.6590 | 0.8464 | 0.0823 | 0.4456 | 0.8575 | 0.9515 | 0.5667 | 0.8631 |\n| 38 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Concat MHA (d_model=320) | Noema I | 22 | 0.6550 | 0.8396 | 0.0786 | 0.4592 | 0.8256 | 0.9517 | 0.5685 | 0.8615 |\n| 37 | 1 | Dilated DSConv (1,2,4,8) + Concat Mean+Max+MHA Pooling | Noema I | 21 | 0.6567 | 0.8451 | 0.0661 | 0.4756 | 0.8247 | 0.9505 | 0.5550 | 0.8800 |\n| 34 | 1 | Dilated DSConv (1,2,4,8) + Concat MHA Pooling (8 heads) | Noema I | 20 | 0.6611 | 0.8330 | 0.0775 | 0.5072 | 0.8425 | 0.9508 | 0.5644 | 0.8523 |\n| 31 | 1 | Dilated DSConv (1,2,4,8) + Concat MHA Pooling | Noema I | 19 | 0.6622 | 0.8367 | 0.0858 | 0.5176 | 0.8288 | 0.9514 | 0.5611 | 0.8538 |\n| 27 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Mean Pooling + Cosine LR Warmup | Noema I | 18 | 0.6063 | 0.8325 | 0.0775 | 0.4417 | 0.6303 | 0.9509 | 0.5699 | 0.7415 |\n| 24 | 1 | Dilated DSConv (1,2,4,8) + Concat\
    \ Mean+Attention Pooling | Noema I | 17 | 0.6477 | 0.8458 | 0.0803 | 0.4381 | 0.8250 | 0.9519 | 0.5650 | 0.8277 |\n| 22 | 1 | Inception DSConv (k=5,9,15) with Mean Pooling | Noema I | 16 | 0.6180 | 0.8442 | 0.0675 | 0.4827 | 0.7305 | 0.9513 | 0.5701 | 0.6800 |\n| 20 | 1 | Concat Mean+Attention Pooling (k=11 DSConv) | Noema I | 15 | 0.6255 | 0.8365 | 0.0769 | 0.4690 | 0.6479 | 0.9509 | 0.5639 | 0.8338 |\n| 17 | 1 | Dilated DSConv (1,2,4,8) with Mean Pooling | Noema I | 14 | 0.6365 | 0.8465 | 0.0663 | 0.4880 | 0.8134 | 0.9525 | 0.5735 | 0.7154 |\n| 16 | 1 | SE(0.25) + k=11 with Mean Pooling (DSConv) | Noema I | 14 | 0.5866 | 0.8435 | 0.0585 | 0.4711 | 0.6491 | 0.9523 | 0.5699 | 0.5615 |\n| 13 | 1 | Kernel Sweep: k=11 with Mean Pooling (DSConv) | Noema I | 12 | 0.6311 | 0.8587 | 0.0651 | 0.4753 | 0.7377 | 0.9521 | 0.5734 | 0.7554 |\n| 12 | 1 | Gated Mean–Attention Pooling (DSConv) | Noema I | 12 | 0.6018 | 0.8584 | 0.0618 | 0.4625 | 0.6698 | 0.9518 | 0.5726 | 0.6354 |\n| 8 | 1 | Ablation:\
    \ Mean Pooling (no attention) | Noema I | 10 | 0.6190 | 0.8565 | 0.0605 | 0.5288 | 0.6807 | 0.9520 | 0.5654 | 0.6892 |\n| 9 | 1 | Ablation: No Depthwise Convs (MLP + attention pooling) | Noema I | 10 | 0.4935 | 0.7424 | 0.0508 | 0.4230 | 0.0579 | 0.9416 | 0.5139 | 0.7246 |\n| 2 | 1 | Depthwise CNN with Attention Pooling for RNA | Noema I | 8 | 0.5917 | 0.7550 | 0.0284 | 0.5150 | 0.6883 | 0.7255 | 0.5637 | 0.8662 |\n| 1 | 1 | Vanilla MLP Baseline | System | 0 | 0.2401 | 0.3258 | 0.0336 | 0.3232 | 0.0402 | 0.6377 | 0.1324 | 0.1877 |\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #2 ('Next steps while Eval 90/91 run'). Full ID: Noema_private_2\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 2 | Next steps while Eval 90/91 run | Noema\
