    \ | 0.0771 | 0.4615 | 0.8188 | 0.9510 | 0.5710 | 0.8585 |\n| 48 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + CLS Attention Pooling (concat mean + cls) | Noema I | 26 | 0.6535 | 0.8278 | 0.0637 | 0.5200 | 0.8236 | 0.9497 | 0.5696 | 0.8200 |\n| 102 | 1 | Ablation: No-PE + Mean + Cross-Half Bilinear Pooling (r=16, no MHA) | Noema I | 51 | 0.6526 | 0.8568 | 0.0540 | 0.4532 | 0.9000 | 0.9500 | 0.5638 | 0.7908 |\n| 33 | 1 | Dilated ResNet CNN for a Wider Receptive Field | Aletheia I | 20 | 0.6521 | 0.8395 | 0.0552 | 0.3751 | 0.8629 | 0.9485 | 0.5480 | 0.9354 |\n| 59 | 1 | Robustness Test: Rerun of Dilated ResNet with Dual Pooling | Aletheia I | 30 | 0.6512 | 0.8389 | 0.0356 | 0.3797 | 0.8695 | 0.9458 | 0.5491 | 0.9400 |\n| 45 | 1 | Dilated DSConv + Concat MHA (kernel_size=9) | Noema I | 24 | 0.6502 | 0.8407 | 0.0757 | 0.4563 | 0.8170 | 0.9511 | 0.5659 | 0.8446 |\n| 35 | 1 | Dilated ResNet CNN with LR Schedule | Aletheia I | 21 | 0.6490 | 0.8365 | 0.0527 | 0.3633 | 0.8678 | 0.9448 | 0.5580 | 0.9200 |\n| 54 | 1 |\
