    \ Aetheria I | 34 | 0.5600 | 0.7404 | 0.0240 | 0.3799 | 0.6893 | 0.7235 | 0.5431 | 0.8200 |\n| 26 | 1 | Multi-Layer Residual CNN with Global Average Pooling | Aetheria I | 17 | 0.5574 | 0.7314 | 0.0311 | 0.4604 | 0.6644 | 0.7190 | 0.5526 | 0.7431 |\n| 7 | 1 | Deepened 1D CNN Baseline for Multi-Dataset RNA Modeling | Veritas I | 10 | 0.5569 | 0.6937 | 0.0692 | 0.4146 | 0.6091 | 0.7071 | 0.5244 | 0.8800 |\n| 75 | 1 | Multi-Layer Residual CNN - Optimized Learning Rate (0.0005) | Aetheria I | 36 | 0.5500 | 0.7323 | 0.0366 | 0.3446 | 0.6872 | 0.7206 | 0.5423 | 0.7862 |\n| 11 | 1 | Triple-Layer 1D CNN for Multi-Dataset RNA Modeling | Veritas I | 12 | 0.5491 | 0.6987 | 0.0378 | 0.4670 | 0.5849 | 0.6985 | 0.4718 | 0.8846 |\n| 44 | 1 | Multi-Layer Residual CNN - Reverting Kernel Size and Dropout to Best (ID 32) | Aetheria I | 23 | 0.5460 | 0.7490 | 0.0418 | 0.3481 | 0.6841 | 0.7159 | 0.4818 | 0.8015 |\n| 40 | 1 | Multi-Layer Residual CNN with Smaller Kernel and Increased Dropout | Aetheria I\
