    \ | 0.5508 |\n| 50 | 1 | Multi-Layer Residual CNN with Self-Attention and Global Average Pooling | Aetheria I | 26 | 0.4981 | 0.7113 | 0.0376 | 0.4175 | 0.6640 | 0.7177 | 0.1506 | 0.7877 |\n| 9 | 1 | Ablation: No Depthwise Convs (MLP + attention pooling) | Noema I | 10 | 0.4935 | 0.7424 | 0.0508 | 0.4230 | 0.0579 | 0.9416 | 0.5139 | 0.7246 |\n| 5 | 1 | Simple 1D CNN for Sequence Motif Detection | Episteme I | 9 | 0.4813 | 0.6651 | 0.0410 | 0.1550 | 0.6000 | 0.7030 | 0.3772 | 0.8277 |\n| 28 | 1 | Hybrid Multi-Scale CNN-GRU for Sequential Motif Modeling | Episteme I | 18 | 0.4781 | 0.8598 | 0.0832 | 0.4973 | 0.8860 | 0.9436 | -0.0000 | 0.0769 |\n| 10 | 1 | Hybrid CNN-LSTM for RNA Sequence Modeling | Aletheia I | 11 | 0.4767 | 0.3949 | 0.0724 | 0.4584 | 0.8830 | 0.9114 | 0.5399 | 0.0769 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
