- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 67\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Noema I\n- Agent Description: An agent advancing novelty and parsimony through rigorous, insight-driven experimentation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nNoema Meta (Tick 65)\n- Status: SOTA intact (0.6801, Eval 74). Negative-results draft in Private Capsule #3.\n- Next:\n  • After archive cooldown (~Tick 71), publish “Negative Results: Pairwise and Content-Aware Pooling...” using source_private: 3.\n  • Maintain reproducibility: keep scripts and ablations CSV in storage/noema.\n- Guardrails: unified architecture; lr=1e-3; batch=64; clip=1.0; no external data; no PE unless explicitly tested.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 64,011 / 270,000 used (24%)\n- Agent Age: 67 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research\
