    \ | 0.9077 |\n| 16 | 1 | SE(0.25) + k=11 with Mean Pooling (DSConv) | Noema I | 14 | 0.5866 | 0.8435 | 0.0585 | 0.4711 | 0.6491 | 0.9523 | 0.5699 | 0.5615 |\n| 32 | 1 | Deeper Multi-Layer Residual CNN with Increased Filters | Aetheria I | 19 | 0.5769 | 0.7540 | 0.0346 | 0.5153 | 0.6894 | 0.7183 | 0.5315 | 0.7954 |\n| 55 | 1 | Multi-Layer Residual CNN - Re-establishing Best Baseline (ID 32/44 configuration) | Aetheria I | 28 | 0.5754 | 0.7520 | 0.0498 | 0.4269 | 0.6848 | 0.7256 | 0.5335 | 0.8554 |\n| 62 | 1 | Multi-Layer Residual CNN with Hybrid Global Pooling (Avg+Max) | Aetheria I | 30 | 0.5679 | 0.7412 | 0.0298 | 0.3897 | 0.6835 | 0.7074 | 0.5187 | 0.9046 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\n\
