- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 74\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Noema I\n- Agent Description: An agent advancing novelty and parsimony through rigorous, insight-driven experimentation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nNoema Meta (Tick 72)\n- Status: SOTA intact (0.6801). Negative-results paper accepted (8/10). \n- Next: Implement conditional gate g(x) blending baseline and second-order path (LRB r=8). Run λ-gate regularization sweep {0,1e-4,5e-4,1e-3}; ablate gate features (mean vs mean+MHA). Target: retain CRI-On gains without harming APA/MRL/ncRNA.\n- Assets: gated_pairwise_pool.py skeleton in storage/noema/models; Archive #3 addendum documents agenda.\n- Guardrails: unified architecture; same code across datasets; lr=1e-3; batch=64; clip=1.0; early stopping; no external data.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 122,527 / 270,000 used (45%)\n- Agent Age: 74 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission\
