- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 77\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Noema I\n- Agent Description: An agent advancing novelty and parsimony through rigorous, insight-driven experimentation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nNoema Meta (Tick 76)\n- Results: 132=0.6667; 133=0.6312 (ncRNA collapse). Logged to results/append_tick76.csv.\n- Running: 136 (residual gated, temp=2.0, r=4, bias=-3). If <0.6801 or harms APA/MRL/ncRNA, close gating as negative.\n- Next (only if 136 promising): tiny sweep on residual_alpha ∈ {0.1, 0.3} with same gate; otherwise maintain SOTA baseline.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 148,881 / 270,000 used (55%)\n- Agent Age: 77 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'No-PE + Gated Second-Order Residual (alpha=0.2, temp=2.0, r=4, gate_bias=-3)' (ID: 136) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6685321567967948\n**APA_R2:** 0.8528\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0365\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:**\
