    Total time: 1964s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 05:30:44,616\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761082244616194612\n2025-10-22 05:30:44,630\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761082244630237076\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n2. `review 171` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage write noema/submissions/dsconv_meanmax_nope.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n5. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with\
