    \ MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1442 |  0.8686  | 0.8752 \n 20  | 0.0937 |  0.8768  | 0.8809 \n 30  | 0.0776 |  0.8752  | 0.8820 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 34 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8820 Time:1318s\n[Complete] MRL val_metric=0.8819688558578491\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.881969\nTraining time: 1327s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best\
    \  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0631 |  0.9516  | 0.9524 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.9524 Time:1823s\n[Complete] Modif val_metric=0.9523858772534998\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.952386\nTraining time: 1839s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: e9549b95-a00e-4073-bc9b-eb3792e13ed9\nTotal time: 1956s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 11:03:22,844\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761102202844316238\n2025-10-22 11:03:22,858\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761102202858231190\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.5)' (ID: 200) succeeded after automatic debugging.\n\n**Score:** 0.6843351275745516\n**APA_R2:** 0.8598\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:**\
    \ 0.0726\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9514\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.5039\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5612\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8830\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9585\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Debugger Report:** # Debug Report for Evaluation 200\n\n## Summary\n**SUCCESS** - Fixed infinite recursion error. The code now runs without crashing and executes for the full timeout period, indicating successful fix.\n\n## Root Cause\nThe original submission had a critical naming conflict that caused infinite recursion:\n\n```python\nfrom dsconv_pool_variants import build_network, create_optimizer\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return create_optimizer(learning_rate)  # ❌ Calls itself!\n```\n\nThe function `create_optimizer` was defined locally with the same name as the imported function. When called, Python resolved the name to the local function definition, causing it to recursively call itself until hitting the recursion limit (RecursionError: maximum recursion\
    \ depth exceeded).\n\n## Fix Applied\nChanged the import statement to use an alias for the imported `create_optimizer` function:\n\n```python\nfrom dsconv_pool_variants import build_network, create_optimizer as create_opt\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return create_opt(learning_rate)  # ✅ Calls the imported function\n```\n\nThis ensures that the local wrapper function correctly calls the imported optimizer creation function from `dsconv_pool_variants.py` instead of recursively calling itself.\n\n## Verification\n- Monitor script confirmed the code ran for 300+ seconds without crashing\n- No RecursionError or other exceptions occurred\n- The simple CPU validation completed successfully\n- Exit code indicates running code (SUCCESS)\n\n## Technical Details\n- **File modified**: `submissions/submission_v2.py`\n- **Change type**: Import alias added to resolve naming conflict\n- **Lines changed**: Line 3 only (`create_optimizer` → `create_optimizer as create_opt`)\n\
    - **Impact**: Complete elimination of infinite recursion, allowing normal execution flow\n\n\n**Important Note:** The debugger cannot modify files in your lineage storage. If your code relies on lineage files, you may need to update them manually.\n\n**Debugged Code (version v2):**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/noema/submissions')\nfrom dsconv_pool_variants import build_network, create_optimizer as create_opt\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 0.001,\n        'd_model': 256,\n        'num_blocks': 5,\n        'dilations': [1,2,4,8,16],\n        'kernel_size': 7,\n        'dropout_rate': 0.1,\n        'positional_encoding': False,\n        'aggregator': 'mean_lse',\n        'tau': 0.5,\n        'topk': 2\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return build_network(hparams.get('d_output', 1), hparams.get('task_type', 'regression'), hparams)\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return create_opt(learning_rate)\n\
    \nBASE_SEED = 42\nBATCH_SIZE = 64\n\ndef complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n    print(f\"[Complete] {trial_data.get('dataset')} val_metric={trial_data.get('val_metric')}\")\n\n```\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward\
    \ pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n \
