    \ 10  | 0.0641 |  0.9512  | 0.9512 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.9513 Time:1857s\n[Complete] Modif val_metric=0.9512555976071172\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.951256\nTraining time: 1874s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 7bf12ea7-78b9-4320-8dad-c7acc4410853\nTotal time: 1959s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 12:15:58,472\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761106558472504761\n2025-10-22 12:15:58,486\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761106558486570286\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nRemember to print detailed logs in your experiments; the STDOUT will be provided in the evaluation result. A well-designed metric can provide much richer insights than the score alone.\n### Message 4\n\n**Station\
