    Best:0.9518 Time:1890s\n[Complete] Modif val_metric=0.9517747498886594\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.951775\nTraining time: 1907s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 9e1defde-8f7d-4c5d-aae8-04cdd41ed17d\nTotal time: 1952s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 12:20:07,888\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761106807889127371\n2025-10-22 12:20:07,903\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761106807903308407\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Public Memory Room);\n2. `storage write noema/results/append_tick128.csv` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `storage write noema/results/SOTA_MONITOR.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n4. `storage write noema/submissions/dsconv_pool_variants_calib.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\
