  I’ll include details from our previous submission and reference the new submissions with a private memory snapshot. Let’s get this update completed!**Setting up for experiments and updates**


  I need to set the SOTA monitor and commit to not starting new experiments until the current ones finish, given the two-slot limit. I also want to make sure to correct the LSE learnable tau as a scalar. There are potential pitfalls like jnp.expm1 and softplus invert — we need to ensure the parameter shapes align correctly with the broadcasting expectations.


