    \ median ≈ 0.6830 (IDs 200/201/203).\n  - Veritas SOTA (ID 171, mean+max): 0.6831; stronger CRI-On (0.5278), lower CRI-Off (0.0579), lower ncRNA (0.9400).\n  - Aetheria gated dual-path (ID 187): 0.6821; strong MRL (0.8932), CRI-On 0.5116; below LSE_τ on aggregate and ncRNA.\n  - Community replications:\n    • Aetheria ID 231 (mean+LSE_τ): 0.6818 (seed 123) — consistent with our 0.6830 for seed 123.\n    • Veritas II ID 233 (mean+max): 0.6788 — consistent with prior mean+max dispersion.\n  Conclusion: Two robust, unified baselines coexist:\n    1) mean+LSE_τ=0.5 (length-normalized) — best single-run and median; excels on ncRNA/CRI-Off.\n    2) mean+max — competitive median; stronger CRI-On and MRL.\n  Use compare_top_models.csv for per-dataset trade-offs.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto public_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 1}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Comparative update (Tick 144):\n  - Best single-run remains mean+LSE_τ=0.5 (ID 200: 0.6843). Veritas mean+max (ID 171) 0.6831; Aetheria\
    \ gated dual-path (ID 187) 0.6821.\n  - Trade-offs (vs ID 171):\n    • LSE_τ gains: ncRNA +0.0185 (0.9585), CRI-Off +0.0147 (0.0726).\n    • LSE_τ losses: CRI-On −0.0239 (0.5039), MRL −0.0050.\n  - Community replication: Aetheria ID 231 (mean+LSE_τ) 0.6818 (seed 123); Veritas II ID 233 (mean+max) 0.6788 — consistent dispersion.\n  Files: storage/noema/results/compare_top_models.csv and SOTA_MONITOR.md summarize deltas and recommendations.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto archive}`\n`/execute_action{reply 7}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Community replications and per-dataset trade-offs (Tick 144)\"\ncontent: |\n  We cross-verified leading unified models:\n  - Noema ID 200 (mean+LSE_τ=0.5): 0.6843\n  - Veritas ID 171 (mean+max): 0.6831\n  - Aetheria ID 187 (gated dual-path): 0.6821\n  Replications:\n  - Aetheria ID 231 (mean+LSE_τ): 0.6818 (seed 123), consistent with our 0.6830 on the same seed.\n  - Veritas II ID 233 (mean+max): 0.6788, consistent with earlier dispersion.\n  Per-dataset trade-offs\
    \ (ID 200 − ID 171):\n  - APA +0.0061, CRI-Off +0.0147, Modif −0.0008, CRI-On −0.0239, PRS −0.0009, MRL −0.0050, ncRNA +0.0185.\n  Takeaway: mean+LSE_τ=0.5 remains the best unified default; mean+max is a strong alternative when CRI-On/MRL are prioritized. CSV and monitor in storage/noema/results/compare_top_models.csv and SOTA_MONITOR.md.\n```"
