role: model
parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{storage write noema/submissions/dsconv_lse_tau05.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/noema/submissions')\n  from dsconv_pool_variants import build_network, create_optimizer as create_opt\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      # Unified DSConv backbone with mean + LSE_τ=0.5 pooling (length-normalized)\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': 0.001,\n          'd_model': 256,\n          'num_blocks': 5,\n          'dilations': [1,2,4,8,16],\n          'kernel_size': 7,\n          'dropout_rate': 0.1,\n          'positional_encoding': False,\n          'aggregator': 'mean_lse',\n          'tau': 0.5,\n          'topk': 2\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return build_network(hparams.get('d_output', 1), hparams.get('task_type', 'regression'), hparams)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return create_opt(learning_rate)\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n  BATCH_SIZE\
    \ = 64\n\n  def complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n      ds = trial_data.get('dataset'); vm = trial_data.get('val_metric')\n      print(f\"[Complete] {ds} val_metric={vm}\")\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Replication: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.25) — length-normalized (seed=123)\"\ntags: \"cnn, pooling, logsumexp, replication, unified\"\nabstract: \"Third seed for τ=0.25 length-normalized LSE to establish median/IQR. Seeds so far: 42=0.6747, 7=0.6859.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/noema/submissions')\n  from dsconv_pool_variants import build_network, create_optimizer\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': 0.001,\n          'd_model': 256,\n          'num_blocks': 5,\n          'dilations': [1,2,4,8,16],\n          'kernel_size': 7,\n          'dropout_rate': 0.1,\n          'positional_encoding': False,\n          'aggregator': 'mean_lse',\n          'tau': 0.25,\n         \
    \ 'topk': 2\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return build_network(hparams.get('d_output', 1), hparams.get('task_type', 'regression'), hparams)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return create_optimizer(learning_rate)\n\n  BASE_SEED = 123\n  BATCH_SIZE = 64\n\n  def complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n      print(f\"[Complete] {trial_data.get('dataset')} val_metric={trial_data.get('val_metric')}\")\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write noema/results/append_tick152.csv}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Tick 152 log\n  NEW_SOTA_SINGLE_RUN,246,mean+LSE_tau0.25_length_norm,seed=7,0.685863,APA 0.8541,CRI-Off 0.0814,CRI-On 0.5276,PRS 0.5572,MRL 0.8816,Modif 0.9515,ncRNA 0.9477\n  SUBMITTED,mean+LSE_tau0.25_length_norm,seed=123\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write noema/results/compare_top_models.csv}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  id,score,APA_R2,CRI-Off_Spearman,CRI-On_Spearman,PRS_R2,MRL_R2,Modif_AUC-ROC,ncRNA_Accuracy,notes\n  246,0.6859,0.8541,0.0814,0.5276,0.5572,0.8816,0.9515,0.9477,\"\
    Noema: mean+LSE τ=0.25 (len-norm), seed=7 (new single-run)\"\n  200,0.6843,0.8598,0.0726,0.5039,0.5612,0.8830,0.9514,0.9585,\"Noema: mean+LSE τ=0.5 (len-norm), seed=42\"\n  171,0.6831,0.8537,0.0579,0.5278,0.5621,0.8880,0.9522,0.9400,\"Veritas: mean+max (No-PE)\"\n  187,0.6821,0.8574,0.0657,0.5116,0.5621,0.8932,0.9525,0.9323,\"Aetheria: gated dual-path\"\n  diff_246_minus_200,0.0016,-0.0057,0.0088,0.0237,-0.0040,-0.0014,0.0001,-0.0108,\"τ=0.25 improves CRI-{On,Off}, reduces ncRNA/MRL\"\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write noema/results/SOTA_MONITOR.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  SOTA Monitor (Tick 152)\n  - New single-run SOTA: ID 246 (mean+LSE τ=0.25, length-normalized, seed=7) = 0.6859.\n    Per-dataset vs τ=0.5 (ID 200): APA -0.0057, CRI-Off +0.0088, CRI-On +0.0237, PRS -0.0040, MRL -0.0014, Modif +0.0001, ncRNA -0.0108.\n  - Seed sensitivity:\n    • Seed 42 (ID 242): 0.6747 (ncRNA ↑, CRI-On ↓)\n    • Seed 7 (ID 246): 0.6859 (CRI-On strong, ncRNA lower)\n    • Seed 123: queued to compute\
