    \ independent discovery.\n4. Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the goal of immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write noema/results/append_tick173.csv` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: noema/results/append_tick173.csv\n\n**Latest\
    \ Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 246 | 1 | Replication: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.25) — length-normalized (seed=7) | Noema I | 150 | 0.6859 | 0.8541 | 0.0814 | 0.5276 | 0.8816 | 0.9515 | 0.5572 | 0.9477 |\n| 200 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.5) | Noema I | 122 | 0.6843 | 0.8598 | 0.0726 | 0.5039 | 0.8830 | 0.9514 | 0.5612 | 0.9585 |\n| 238 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling (tau=0.25) and GELU (Multi-seed Run 2, Seed 7) | Aetheria I | 146 | 0.6837 | 0.8566 | 0.0827 | 0.5051 | 0.8752 | 0.9503 | 0.5608\
    \ | 0.9554 |\n| 171 | 1 | Ablation: DSConv with Hybrid Mean-Max Pooling (No GRU, No-PE) | Veritas I | 100 | 0.6831 | 0.8537 | 0.0579 | 0.5278 | 0.8880 | 0.9522 | 0.5621 | 0.9400 |\n| 203 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.5) — Seed=123 | Noema I | 124 | 0.6830 | 0.8589 | 0.0783 | 0.5039 | 0.8779 | 0.9512 | 0.5584 | 0.9523 |\n| 167 | 1 | Replication: Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM (No-PE) — Seed=7 | Noema I | 98 | 0.6828 | 0.8613 | 0.0752 | 0.5090 | 0.8999 | 0.9492 | 0.5638 | 0.9215 |\n| 261 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Re-verification: Conditional Head Dropout (CRI-Off 0.05, Backbone 0.1) - Run 2 | Veritas II | 167 | 0.6827 | 0.8570 | 0.0624 | 0.5083 | 0.8880 | 0.9517 | 0.5653 | 0.9462 |\n| 187 | 1 | Gated Dual-Path DSConv-HybridPool & DSConv-BiLSTM-Attn (No-PE) | Aetheria I | 111 | 0.6821 | 0.8574 | 0.0657 | 0.5116 | 0.8932 | 0.9525 | 0.5621 | 0.9323 |\n| 178 | 1 | Replication: DSConv Hybrid Mean+Max (No-PE) — Seed=123 | Noema I | 104 | 0.6820 | 0.8588 | 0.0795 | 0.4981 | 0.8832 | 0.9502\
    \ | 0.5553 | 0.9492 |\n| 175 | 1 | Replication: DSConv Hybrid Mean+Max (No-PE) — Seed=42 | Noema I | 102 | 0.6819 | 0.8577 | 0.0782 | 0.4948 | 0.8792 | 0.9517 | 0.5611 | 0.9508 |\n| 231 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling and GELU (Multi-seed Run 3, Seed 123) | Aetheria I | 141 | 0.6818 | 0.8587 | 0.0679 | 0.4992 | 0.8888 | 0.9512 | 0.5549 | 0.9523 |\n| 236 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling (tau=0.25) and GELU (Multi-seed Run 1, Seed 1) | Aetheria I | 145 | 0.6818 | 0.8553 | 0.0715 | 0.5134 | 0.8746 | 0.9517 | 0.5630 | 0.9431 |\n| 170 | 1 | Replication: Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM (No-PE) — Seed=123 | Noema I | 99 | 0.6817 | 0.8575 | 0.0753 | 0.4988 | 0.8962 | 0.9507 | 0.5671 | 0.9262 |\n| 160 | 1 | Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention Pooling (No-PE) - Re-establishing Baseline (ID 140) | Aetheria I | 93 | 0.6816 | 0.8557 | 0.0819 | 0.4838 | 0.8976 | 0.9502 | 0.5632 | 0.9385 |\n| 190 | 1 | Replication: Gated Dual-Path (No-PE) — Seed=7 | Noema I | 114 | 0.6809 | 0.8585 | 0.0563 | 0.4972\
    \ | 0.8909 | 0.9513 | 0.5659 | 0.9462 |\n| 241 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling (tau=0.25) and GELU (Multi-seed Run 3, Seed 123) | Aetheria I | 147 | 0.6807 | 0.8552 | 0.0664 | 0.4989 | 0.8795 | 0.9508 | 0.5585 | 0.9554 |\n| 193 | 1 | Gated Dual-Path Feature Fusion: Veritas SOTA (DSConv-HybridPool) + Aetheria SOTA (DSConv-BiLSTM-A... | Veritas I | 115 | 0.6805 | 0.8559 | 0.0640 | 0.4926 | 0.8899 | 0.9529 | 0.5622 | 0.9462 |\n| 197 | 1 | Precise SOTA Replication: Aetheria's Gated Dual-Path (ID 187) | Veritas I | 119 | 0.6804 | 0.8583 | 0.0545 | 0.4968 | 0.8943 | 0.9528 | 0.5647 | 0.9415 |\n| 74 | 1 | No-PE + Concat MHA (5 blocks, attn_temp=0.5) | Noema I | 36 | 0.6801 | 0.8598 | 0.0788 | 0.4883 | 0.8928 | 0.9504 | 0.5627 | 0.9277 |\n| 254 | 1 | Dual-Path Soft-Extreme: concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.5, LSE_tau=0.25) — unified DSConv | Noema I | 158 | 0.6796 | 0.8555 | 0.0826 | 0.4787 | 0.8808 | 0.9508 | 0.5568 | 0.9523 |\n\nPage 1 of 14 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to\
    \ navigate pages 1-14, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
