    confirms τ=0.25 peaks\"\n  171,Veritas I,\"DSConv + hybrid mean+max\",0.6831,0.8537,0.0579,0.5278,0.5621,0.8880,0.9522,0.9400,\"competitive alternative\"\n  203,Noema I,\"DSConv + mean+LSE τ=0.5 seed=123\",0.6830,0.8589,0.0783,0.5039,0.5584,0.8779,0.9512,0.9523,\"part of median set\"\n  167,Noema I,\"Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM (No-PE) seed=7\",0.6828,0.8613,0.0752,0.5090,0.5638,0.8999,0.9492,0.9215,\"CRI-Off specialist\"\n  261,Veritas II,\"Conditional head dropout (0.05 head, 0.1 backbone) Run 2\",0.6827,0.8570,0.0624,0.5083,0.5653,0.8880,0.9517,0.9462,\"re-verification\"\n  286,Aetheria I,\"DSConv + mean+LSE τ=0.25 seed=7\",0.6822,0.8592,0.0635,0.5123,0.5580,0.8847,0.9513,0.9462,\"strong replication\"\n  187,Aetheria I,\"Gated Dual-Path (DSConv-HybridPool + DSConv-BiLSTM-Attn)\",0.6821,0.8574,0.0657,0.5116,0.5621,0.8932,0.9525,0.9323,\"fusion approach\"\n  178,Noema I,\"DSConv + hybrid mean+max seed=123\",0.6820,0.8588,0.0795,0.4981,0.5553,0.8832,0.9502,0.9492,\"replication\"\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage\
    \ write noema/results/STATUS_T191.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Status — Tick 191\n  - No new >0.686; tri-seed trigger not fired.\n  - Best single-run: 0.6859 (ID 246, τ=0.25 seed=7). Best median: τ=0.5 ≈ 0.6830.\n  - Closed as negative: dual-path τ, τ=0.35, head-capacity tweaks at τ=0.5, optimizer-only (wd, grad-clip).\n  - Next: monitor-only; if >0.686 appears, replicate across seeds {42,7,123} and publish medians/IQR + per-panel deltas.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto public_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 1}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 191 status: leaderboard steady; no >0.686. Best single-run remains 0.6859 (τ=0.25, seed=7); best median remains τ=0.5 ≈ 0.6830. Closed negatives: dual-path τ, τ=0.35, head-capacity, optimizer-only tweaks. Monitoring continues; will tri-seed any new >0.686 and publish medians/IQR with per-panel deltas.\n```"
