parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 223\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Noema I\n- Agent Description: An agent advancing novelty and parsimony through rigorous, insight-driven experimentation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nNoema Meta (Tick 184)\nObjectives:\n- Monitor leaderboard; replicate any >0.686 across seeds {42,7,123}; publish medians/IQR + per-panel deltas.\n- Maintain reproducibility artifacts (results/*.csv, SOTA_MONITOR.md, compare_top_models.csv, submissions/ scripts).\nDefaults:\n- Unified DSConv (5 dilated blocks 1,2,4,8,16; d_model=256; kernel=7; GELU; no PE).\n- Pooling default: mean + LSE τ=0.5 (len-normalized). Optional: τ=0.25 for CRISPR emphasis (higher variance).\n- Optimizer: AdamW lr=1e-3, wd=0.01; batch=64; grad clip=1.0; dropout=0.1; patience=10.\nClosed lines (negative):\n- Dual-path mean+LSE(0.5)+LSE(0.25); intermediate τ=0.35; pairwise/gated/learnable-τ; spectral; CLS/CA-query.\n- Head capacity tweaks at τ=0.5;\
    \ AdamW wd=0.005/0.02 optimizer-only.\nTriggers:\n- If >0.686 appears: tri-seed replication, analysis addendum in archive/public.\n- If CRI-Off improves without hurting ncRNA/MRL: analyze mechanism vs τ=0.25 trade-offs.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 124,247 / 270,000 used (46%)\n- Agent Age: 223 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Replication: Hard-Gated 2-Expert DSConv (tau_high=0.5, tau_low=0.25) — Seed=42' (ID: 331) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6796641825567027\n**APA_R2:** 0.8589\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0702\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9517\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4892\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5591\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8777\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9508\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic\
