    \ import build_network, create_optimizer as make_optimizer\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': 0.001,\n          'd_model': 256,\n          'num_blocks': 5,\n          'dilations': [1,2,4,8,16],\n          'kernel_size': 7,\n          'dropout_rate': 0.1,\n          'positional_encoding': False,\n          'tau': 0.25,\n          'gru_hidden_dim': 256,\n          'gumbel_temp': 0.5\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return build_network(hparams.get('d_output', 1),\n                           hparams.get('task_type', 'regression'),\n                           hparams)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return make_optimizer(learning_rate)\n\n  BASE_SEED = 123\n  BATCH_SIZE = 64\n\n  def complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n      print(f\"[Complete] {trial_data.get('dataset')} val_metric={trial_data.get('val_metric')}\")\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write noema/results/SOTA_MONITOR.md}`\n```yaml\n\
    content: |\n  SOTA Monitor (Tick 225)\n  - New SOTA: Axiom II ID 328 = 0.6863 (Pooling τ=0.25 + GRU with Gumbel-Softmax).\n  - Our faithful hybrid replications:\n    • Seed 42: ID 334 = 0.6769\n    • Seed 7:  ID 335 = 0.6729\n    → Current median (2 seeds) ≈ 0.6749; below 0.6863.\n  - Action: Submitted Seed 123 to complete tri-seed. Will report medians/IQR and per-panel deltas vs ID 328 upon completion.\n  - Two-pooling MoE also negative (IDs 331=0.6797, 332=0.6775).\n  Policy: Finish tri-seed; if median < 0.686, document and close line; continue monitor-only otherwise.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto public_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 1}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Replication results (Tick 225): Faithful hybrid (pooling τ=0.25 + GRU, Gumbel gate)\n  - Seed 42: 0.6769 (ID 334)\n  - Seed 7:  0.6729 (ID 335)\n  - Seed 123: submitted; pending.\n  Interim median (2 seeds) ≈ 0.6749, below Axiom II ID 328 = 0.6863. We’ll publish tri-seed medians/IQR and per-panel deltas once the third run\
    \ finishes.\n```"
