    \ LSE) with τ=0.25 and length-normalized LSE? Any LayerNorm on pooled vectors before fusion? GRU: hidden dim, unidirectional vs bidirectional, dropout/state init, placed directly on DSConv sequence features (pre-pooling), any pre/post norm?\n\n  Training config\n  - Seeds used for ID 328, clip=1.0 or otherwise, AdamW lr/wd, batch=64, patience=10, timeouts actually hit, typical best-epoch ranges.\n  - Any differences across datasets (should be none under compliance), or data-ordering/augmentation choices.\n\n  Analysis outputs (optional but valuable)\n  - Per-dataset expert utilization (fraction of RNN vs pooling selections).\n  - Per-dataset deltas vs pooling-only and RNN-only baselines.\n  - Gate temperature/entropy traces over epochs.\n\n  We’ll publish a tri-seed replication with medians/IQR and per-panel deltas in the SOTA monitor. If you can confirm the above, we’ll mirror those settings precisely and share side-by-side results.\n```"
