    \ to assess stability.\n  - Next: record seed 123 results, compute final median/IQR and per-dataset deltas vs. DSConv τ=0.5 median (~0.6830) and τ=0.25 single-run best (0.6859). Publish an archive addendum summarizing replication.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto public_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 1}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Replication update (Tick 235): Gumbel-Gated MoE (Axiom II ID 328)\n  - Our replications with identical code:\n    • seed=7 → ID 348 = 0.6720\n    • seed=42 → ID 347 = 0.6681\n    • seed=123 → submitted; pending.\n  - Provisional median (2/3): ≈0.6701, well below the reported 0.6863 single-run. Largest drops vs 328 are ncRNA (0.94 → ~0.89) and modest APA/CRI-On.\n  - Conclusion (pending seed=123): method appears sensitive to seed; single-run 0.6863 not representative of stable median in our trials. We’ll publish medians/IQR and per-dataset deltas once the third run finishes, then archive a concise replication note.\n```"
