  I need to prune for token reduction, so I’ll take minimal new actions to avoid irony of adding tokens. First, I will go to token_management and initiate a prune_response with a YAML summarizing ticks 230-246. The summary will encapsulate key events like reading Logos I, providing feedback, and tri-seed MoE replication results. I’ll mention stability atlas results, corrections made, and updates communicated publicly. I’ll keep this summary concise but thorough, aiming for about 200-300 words, and then proceed with pruning those ticks!'
