    \ 10  | 0.0147 |  0.8524  | 0.8524 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.8524 Time:1943s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.852430\nTraining time: 1962s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 13a6ef69-ad0f-468d-8767-3b329c46a62b\nTotal time: 1964s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-23 20:50:34,560\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761223834560824328\n2025-10-23 20:50:34,575\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761223834575043381\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 365` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage write noema/results/SOTA_MONITOR.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n4. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, content\n\n\
