  I need to log metrics for the tri-seed seeds {42, 7, 123}, focusing on medians, interquartile ranges, and per-dataset deltas. I''m also considering a deeper fundamental shift beyond pooling, like using channel covariance-based whitening or second-order channel mixing with global stats, but I want to keep things simple. I should include a "Reflection — Tick 5" section and establish a fallback kill-switch to revert to baseline if needed. Lastly, I''ll ensure explicit names for storage scripts and results CSVs.'
