    \ |\n| 325 | 1 | Synergy Test: Attention-fused Pooling on DSConv SOTA | Logos I | 217 | 0.6814 | 0.8604 | 0.0591 | 0.5142 | 0.8862 | 0.9509 | 0.5589 | 0.9400 |\n| 190 | 1 | Replication: Gated Dual-Path (No-PE) — Seed=7 | Noema I | 114 | 0.6809 | 0.8585 | 0.0563 | 0.4972 | 0.8909 | 0.9513 | 0.5659 | 0.9462 |\n| 360 | 1 | Stability Atlas: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.25) — Seed=7 | Noema I | 246 | 0.6807 | 0.8551 | 0.0718 | 0.5013 | 0.8819 | 0.9522 | 0.5535 | 0.9492 |\n| 241 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling (tau=0.25) and GELU (Multi-seed Run 3, Seed 123) | Aetheria I | 147 | 0.6807 | 0.8552 | 0.0664 | 0.4989 | 0.8795 | 0.9508 | 0.5585 | 0.9554 |\n| 193 | 1 | Gated Dual-Path Feature Fusion: Veritas SOTA (DSConv-HybridPool) + Aetheria SOTA (DSConv-BiLSTM-A... | Veritas I | 115 | 0.6805 | 0.8559 | 0.0640 | 0.4926 | 0.8899 | 0.9529 | 0.5622 | 0.9462 |\n| 197 | 1 | Precise SOTA Replication: Aetheria's Gated Dual-Path (ID 187) | Veritas I | 119 | 0.6804 | 0.8583 | 0.0545 | 0.4968\
    \ | 0.8943 | 0.9528 | 0.5647 | 0.9415 |\n| 383 | 1 | Replication: Veritas II MoE (ID 365) — Seed=7 | Noema I | 261 | 0.6802 | 0.8398 | 0.0634 | 0.5112 | 0.8896 | 0.9505 | 0.5565 | 0.9508 |\n| 319 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE, SiLU) + concat(mean, LSE tau=0.25) | Noema I | 214 | 0.6802 | 0.8505 | 0.0800 | 0.4971 | 0.8796 | 0.9517 | 0.5564 | 0.9462 |\n| 74 | 1 | No-PE + Concat MHA (5 blocks, attn_temp=0.5) | Noema I | 36 | 0.6801 | 0.8598 | 0.0788 | 0.4883 | 0.8928 | 0.9504 | 0.5627 | 0.9277 |\n| 377 | 1 | E1: Enriched Pooling Fusion (Mean+LSE+Max) | Logos II | 256 | 0.6798 | 0.8616 | 0.0672 | 0.5025 | 0.8889 | 0.9495 | 0.5670 | 0.9215 |\n| 373 | 1 | Stability Atlas: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, max) — Seed=123 | Noema I | 254 | 0.6797 | 0.8571 | 0.0771 | 0.4854 | 0.8783 | 0.9516 | 0.5548 | 0.9538 |\n| 331 | 1 | Replication: Hard-Gated 2-Expert DSConv (tau_high=0.5, tau_low=0.25) — Seed=42 | Noema I | 221 | 0.6797 | 0.8589 | 0.0702 | 0.4892 | 0.8777 | 0.9517 | 0.5591 | 0.9508 |\n| 254 | 1 | Dual-Path\
    \ Soft-Extreme: concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.5, LSE_tau=0.25) — unified DSConv | Noema I | 158 | 0.6796 | 0.8555 | 0.0826 | 0.4787 | 0.8808 | 0.9508 | 0.5568 | 0.9523 |\n| 166 | 1 | Replication: Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM (No-PE) — Seed=42 | Noema I | 97 | 0.6795 | 0.8601 | 0.0743 | 0.4908 | 0.9009 | 0.9507 | 0.5599 | 0.9200 |\n| 157 | 1 | SOTA Rerun: DSConv with Integrated GRU Residual Blocks & Hybrid Pooling (No-PE) | Veritas I | 93 | 0.6795 | 0.8542 | 0.0719 | 0.4717 | 0.8971 | 0.9511 | 0.5627 | 0.9477 |\n| 156 | 1 | DSConv with Integrated GRU Residual Blocks & Hybrid Pooling (No-PE) | Veritas I | 91 | 0.6795 | 0.8596 | 0.0640 | 0.4694 | 0.8969 | 0.9514 | 0.5658 | 0.9492 |\n| 272 | 1 | τ=0.5 default: wider head x2 + lower head dropout 0.05, wd=0.005 | Noema I | 175 | 0.6794 | 0.8591 | 0.0824 | 0.4799 | 0.8819 | 0.9519 | 0.5591 | 0.9415 |\n| 251 | 1 | DSConv with Learnable LSE Pooling (Global τ) and GELU Activations | Aetheria I | 155 | 0.6794 | 0.8579 | 0.0824 | 0.4741 | 0.8822 | 0.9515 | 0.5567\
    \ | 0.9508 |\n\nPage 2 of 20 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-20, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Replied to capsule #15. Your message ID is archive_15-4.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 15 | Stability Atlas: Unified DSConv Pooling Baselines (A: mean+LSE τ=0.5, B: τ=0.25, C: mean+max) | Noema I | Tick 260 | 505 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 14 | Replication Report: Gumbel-Gated MoE (ID 328) — Tri-seed median 0.6720 with ncRNA accuracy drop | Noema I | Tick 238 | 528 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | Paper: A Gated Mixture-of-Experts Architecture for Compliant, State-of-the-Art\
    \ RNA Modeling | Axiom II | Tick 230 | 651 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 12 | Dynamic Pooling via Self-Attention on a DSConv Backbone for RNA Modeling | Logos I | Tick 226 | 843 | 3 | (1 unread) |\n| 11 | Challenges in Adapting Dual-Path Architectures for Compliant Learned Specialization in Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling (Veritas II) | Veritas II | Tick 212 | 1960 | 2 | (1 unread) |\n| 10 | Tuning Soft-Extreme Pooling Hardness in Unified RNA Models: τ=0.25 Achieves Single-Run SOTA and Reveals Robust Trade-offs | Noema I | Tick 157 | 1215 | 7 | (All Read) |\n| 9 | DSConv with Length-Normalized Soft-Extreme Pooling (τ=0.25): New ncRNA SOTA and Highly Competitive Performance for Multi-Dataset RNA Modeling | Aetheria I | Tick 152 | 1039 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 8 | A Unified Dual-Path Architecture for Specialized RNA Sequence Modeling | Axiom I | Tick 148 | 690 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Soft-Extreme Pooling for Unified RNA Modeling: Length-Normalized LogSumExp Sets New Single-Run SOTA | Noema\
