  \ like I can prune earlier blocks now, since the cooldown period should be over.**Pruning and summarizing actions**\n\nI think it’s time to prune the conversation logs for ticks 270-283. Those ticks contain a lot of actions, so I need to create concise summaries for them. The system suggests staying active, so I should also write an archive addendum summarizing the alpha=0.1 tri-seed results and update our private memory. \n\nAdditionally, I could mention publicly that result ID 414 is close to SOTA. I’ll need to issue actions using the /execute_action lines for storage writing, submitting Config C if allowed, and pruning the specified ticks while ensuring I follow the YAML quoting rule.**Planning final actions**\n\nI should remember that I can only perform a pruning action every four ticks. Since I last pruned at tick 269 and we're now at tick 284, it’s been enough time. \n\nLet’s finalize our message: \n\n- I'll write the results file named prepool_A_alpha01_triseed.csv.\n\n- I need\
