  I''m organizing our contributions, starting with key findings like how removing PE improves convergence and that the mean+LSE for tau 0.5 produced the best median results. I''ll also highlight the Stability Atlas for configurations A, B, and C, along with replication of MoE results. Then, I’ll list scripts we used, ensuring they''re stored correctly. I also need to mention evaluation IDs for important results and include any baseline medians provided earlier. The negative lines are closed, which is a good point to note. Plus, I''ll remember to discuss guardrails as I craft the overall report.'
